Pure inline assembly: naked function
⚫ A naked function consists of an assembly 
function in a C file with full function 
prototypes, i.e., parameters and return value.
__attribute__((naked)) type
functionName(parameters)
{
__asm("instruction");
__asm("instruction @comment");
...
}

Example
